OL,3,GNEWSADelayed regeneration project gets
OL,4,Aoff the ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started on a delayed #130m
OL,7,Fregeneration project after issues with
OL,8,F"power capacity" were resolved,
OL,9,Fdevelopers have said.
OL,11,FHouses and a gas tower were demolished
OL,12,Fin 2013 at Four Waterside in
OL,13,FNorthampton, next to the town's railway
OL,14,Fstation. Plans were first submitted in
OL,15,F2016.
OL,17,FThe developer Cityheart said it was
OL,18,Fworking with West Northamptonshire
OL,19,FCouncil on the project and four months
OL,20,Fof preparation work was being carried
OL,21,Fout by PP O'Connor.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
